  The templates of `verify_tables`' table evaluations: the 153 words read, each copied,
  and the 38 permutations between them.
  `scripts/b1c-vt/all.py` writes the data `vtEvalData` and `vtPermData` (`regen-guest.sh`, step
  `vt`).
-/

